    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28949" root="عزب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْزِبٌ</span></b>  One <i>who goes away from his family with
his camels.</i> (Az, TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزَبٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزِيبٌ</span>
&amp;c.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>Seeking distant herbage, such as is
termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَازِبٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And One <i>whose camels
go away to a distance in the pasturage, not to return in the evening.</i> (S, TA.)

